{"id":"b8761ca2-b032-4f32-ab37-c04901411c6c","expr":"declaredClass != null","rationale":"Typical usage expects a declaredClass to exclude, so it's commonly non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:04.353576959Z"}
