{"id":"2967dea7-aa44-498e-becf-215bb1c05d3f","expr":"!result.test(null) || declaredClass == null","rationale":"The predicate returns false only when declaredClass equals the declaring class of the method argument; if the argument is null, test(null) would be true unless declaredClass is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#excludedDeclaredClass(Class<?>):Predicate<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:05.087919589Z"}
{"id":"7fe5c18a-e00e-4a52-aa82-8bfbb440fcd7","expr":"includeInheritedTypes == (includeInheritedTypes)","rationale":"includeInheritedTypes and publicOnly are boolean parameters whose boolean values can be used in conditionals later.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:06.140165472Z"}
{"id":"f56c3bd5-2906-4dce-8611-1f495249851f","expr":"publicOnly == (publicOnly)","rationale":"publicOnly parameter is boolean, used to select methods to fetch.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:06.140165472Z"}
{"id":"66408e8d-13cd-4bc2-943a-66f6b9ff0079","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"methodsToFilter is a predicate parameter that may be null or non-null; if non-null, it is used to filter methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:06.140165472Z"}
{"id":"03ad077b-a64d-4134-a183-cb4fc893b85a","expr":"declaringClass.isInterface() == declaringClass.isInterface()","rationale":"declaringClass is not null and non-primitive, so calling isInterface is safe and can be used for filtering or logic later.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:06.140165472Z"}
{"id":"457e55b9-95f4-4b0f-a94b-c1fbd725fa73","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The code returns either an emptyList() or an unmodifiableList, both non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:07.806631141Z"}
{"id":"167f3ece-c39e-4c2c-b4bd-bfedb85df169","expr":"(!includeInheritedTypes || result.size() >= declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods().length)","rationale":"If includeInheritedTypes is true, methods from inherited types are added, so result size cannot be less than declared methods count.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,boolean,boolean,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:07.806631141Z"}
{"id":"c1316a12-69d1-4a4b-81be-bfe0963ea9ed","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"getDeclaredMethods requires a non-null declaringClass to fetch methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:08.700998497Z"}
{"id":"4b9baaa8-3188-4d14-930d-31c4701fe337","expr":"methodsToFilter == null || methodsToFilter.length >= 0","rationale":"The variable methodsToFilter is a varargs argument that may be null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:08.700998497Z"}
{"id":"cad27503-8664-4eea-a8bb-580e85263855","expr":"methodsToFilter == null || methodsToFilter.length <= 10","rationale":"Typically filtering predicates arrays are small; this captures a reasonable constraint on their size size.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:08.700998497Z"}
{"id":"dd726cb0-714e-4ed9-84e7-5727405ce18a","expr":"result != null","rationale":"According to the method contract, result List is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:09.201367518Z"}
{"id":"19b01f82-bc14-48dc-9a0a-b5b436c17030","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods().length == 0","rationale":"If no declared methods return, declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods must be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:09.201367518Z"}
{"id":"9c3ca627-cb9c-476a-a3ac-9a138b3845d8","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"The declaringClass must be non-null to retrieve methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:09.611126045Z"}
{"id":"24719190-9d4f-4a32-a8b5-5f7319d8f54c","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"The methodsToFilter array is never null as it is a vararg parameter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:09.611126045Z"}
{"id":"1ba39d70-0993-4fe2-a05b-b4a4ef8bf889","expr":"! (methodsToFilter.length == 0) || methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"Either no filters are provided, or the filters array is non-null to hold them.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:09.611126045Z"}
{"id":"d28a5f49-abea-450c-a2b3-8ab06ff66618","expr":"! (declaringClass.isPrimitive())","rationale":"Primitive types do not have methods, so declaringClass is likely not primitive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:09.611126045Z"}
{"id":"8a5d5b5c-a2bb-4ba4-8cea-4c1194a25928","expr":"!declaringClass.isArray()","rationale":"Getting methods of an array type is likely not a usual case in this method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:09.611126045Z"}
{"id":"f8f48ab2-ffb5-41ce-b708-fc58a8a0ec6b","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"The method requires a non-null declaringClass to fetch its methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:11.361706148Z"}
{"id":"0c764e6e-1fb3-46eb-a419-7770e661429c","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"Even if no filters are provided, the array reference should not be null to avoid NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:11.361706148Z"}
{"id":"d84a708e-7ddb-41c1-9bbd-bb1cdbb71a7c","expr":"methodsToFilter.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is non-negative by definition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:11.361706148Z"}
{"id":"0c6b118d-f90b-4550-bf9c-d14051145c9d","expr":"declaringClass.getDeclaredMethods().length >= 0","rationale":"The number of declared methods is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:11.361706148Z"}
{"id":"bcffcf47-86bc-4d02-864b-e053c74da78b","expr":"!declaringClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Typically used with declared classes, which are not primitive types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:11.361706148Z"}
{"id":"c49a2020-5145-4d2b-bf86-85fd4e987a1b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method's Javadoc specifies that the returned List is non-null (a non-null read-only List).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:12.073063028Z"}
{"id":"2697c979-52e4-483d-a3ff-b771280f2e4c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned list of methods is always non-null according to the specification.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:13.468336378Z"}
{"id":"86680822-3988-4e97-89c1-57e047f33ee5","expr":"result.size() >= 0","rationale":"The result list size is always zero or more.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllDeclaredMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:13.468336378Z"}
{"id":"9aa29b40-1732-432f-9d46-71568beb6837","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"The declaringClass must be non-null because the method retrieves methods declared in a class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:13.620082741Z"}
{"id":"6dbf3fa0-20d2-4a44-8e7d-260b094cf941","expr":"methodsToFilter != null","rationale":"methodsToFilter is a varargs parameter and typically not null; even if empty, the array should exist.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:13.620082741Z"}
{"id":"9a0b99da-6435-4db7-bd98-c57584393714","expr":"methodsToFilter.length >= 0","rationale":"The array length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:13.620082741Z"}
{"id":"d4e033ee-575e-483f-a344-4b8d4ca60c5a","expr":"(methodsToFilter.length == 0) || (methodsToFilter[0] != null)","rationale":"If filters are passed, at least the first predicate should be non-null to filter methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:13.620082741Z"}
{"id":"6eae7a5d-50db-4d6b-a7c1-6b509928aabd","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method is documented to return a non-null list, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:16.200754831Z"}
{"id":"8e19ab9d-b5f5-4ef5-9a04-edafae0b3159","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || declaringClass.getMethods().length == 0","rationale":"If there are no public methods, the returned list may be empty; otherwise, it should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#getAllMethods(Class<?>,Predicate<Method>):List<Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:16.200754831Z"}
{"id":"667e7f3b-1af6-4468-8c60-55218b0dcadb","expr":"type != null","rationale":"A method cannot be found on a null class, thus type is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:16.372450587Z"}
{"id":"0c9b6413-ad74-4333-90a2-b4400e78cd7c","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"A method name is essential to search for a method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:16.372450587Z"}
{"id":"8aa041c7-cf3c-4d96-b686-4a5662a50d65","expr":"methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"Empty string as a method name is uncommon and likely invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:16.372450587Z"}
{"id":"c0d74a6d-a68f-4d24-93c6-54afba8cbad6","expr":"type.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Finding a method on an interface may not be the primary use case, assuming the method targets concrete types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:16.372450587Z"}
{"id":"da5c9ed2-393f-475e-993d-e7b6e2bbb043","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The method checks if type is null before calling getDeclaredMethod, indicating type should not be null for meaningful operation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:17.312889330Z"}
{"id":"5e5244f6-d542-4aa6-8c87-a6535115fabb","expr":"methodName != null && !methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method uses isNotEmpty on methodName to proceed; so methodName must be non-null and not empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:17.312889330Z"}
{"id":"a116ea86-373e-4726-a559-696cef7e7b90","expr":"parameterTypes != null","rationale":"parameterTypes should not be null as it's passed to getDeclaredMethod; it may be empty array but not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:17.312889330Z"}
{"id":"7960f6a7-5f0f-405a-9638-a49afbf98fd3","expr":"type.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Methods are generally declared in classes rather than interfaces; findMethod likely targets class types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:17.312889330Z"}
{"id":"424f2655-a987-4b07-aed4-562dc556b077","expr":"parameterTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"parameterTypes is a vararg array, so it must be an array type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:17.312889330Z"}
{"id":"802143ca-c30a-402c-a07f-6f9433ef12f9","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"The findMethod function is expected to return a Method object whose name matches the methodName parameter, or null if not found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:17.549161233Z"}
{"id":"fb76c5a4-53b4-420f-b869-64e5d4d73603","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(type)","rationale":"The found Method should be declared on a class assignable from the 'type' parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:17.549161233Z"}
{"id":"49921c57-f9f2-4c3e-b13d-3c9df5dff00b","expr":"result == null || methodName != null","rationale":"Finding a method requires a non-null method name string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:17.549161233Z"}
{"id":"f18ae739-5f85-4abf-94dc-435aafeba271","expr":"result == null || result.getParameterCount() == 0","rationale":"The method is found by matching method name without parameters so parameter count should be zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:17.549161233Z"}
{"id":"5336eb92-5f8f-4ed5-954f-899593f91ed2","expr":"object != null","rationale":"The object must not be null at method entry to retrieve its class and to invoke methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:20.267376449Z"}
{"id":"a6af2e84-2310-49f1-867a-a821870d618d","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"methodName must be non-null to find the corresponding method in the class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:20.267376449Z"}
{"id":"db772fd2-faf8-4fb6-85cf-dfd5726f6e84","expr":"methodParameters == null || methodParameters.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"methodParameters is declared as Object... (varargs), so it is either null or an Object array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:20.267376449Z"}
{"id":"785e56d2-5a2e-4713-8bad-b3684b12c274","expr":"object.getClass() != null","rationale":"Because object is not null, object.getClass() returns a non-null Class instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeMethod(Object,String,Object):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:20.267376449Z"}
{"id":"1bbf133c-ff5b-42b5-8422-5e2778e7c2cc","expr":"(result != null) || (type != null && methodName != null && methodName.length() > 0)","rationale":"If the method is found (result != null), then type and methodName are valid according to preconditions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:20.871667160Z"}
{"id":"0efb9e5d-d6e0-4531-a231-c6b144b85027","expr":"result == null || methodName.equals(result.getName())","rationale":"If a method is returned, it must have the specified method name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:20.871667160Z"}
{"id":"3147f896-11f8-4ea8-83ce-a919ac10759b","expr":"result == null || type.equals(result.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"If a method is returned, it must belong to the given type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:20.871667160Z"}
{"id":"699016fa-28d9-4a55-947c-b4cbe6666104","expr":"result == null || (type != null && methodName != null && methodName.length() > 0)","rationale":"If a method is found, the inputs type and methodName are valid (non-null and non-empty).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findMethod(Class,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:20.871667160Z"}
{"id":"1e03abff-77cc-48c2-92b1-22d872747cf2","expr":"overrider != null","rationale":"The method returns false if overrider is null, so usually it should be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:21.185326971Z"}
{"id":"b96eb922-41aa-4922-9b7f-68ed8da83ca3","expr":"overridden != null","rationale":"The method returns false if overridden is null, so usually it should be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:21.185326971Z"}
{"id":"fda8aef0-02ee-40fe-b391-22dfa5ffd6d6","expr":"!Objects.equals(overrider, overridden)","rationale":"The method returns false if overrider equals overridden, so usually they are distinct.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:21.185326971Z"}
{"id":"b8f1b89d-4510-402b-a26f-0f835e41f7db","expr":"result == false || (overrider != null && overridden != null)","rationale":"If the result is true, then both methods must be non-null as per the initial checks.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:24.100667913Z"}
{"id":"e8a11541-b96a-4db2-bc04-49b06577dd2a","expr":"!result || !Objects.equals(overrider, overridden)","rationale":"If result is true, overrider and overridden must not be equal methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:24.100667913Z"}
{"id":"395d1dd4-1308-410c-8d95-15b4398f4b12","expr":"!result || overridden.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(overrider.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"Overriding requires overrider's declaring class to be assignable from overridden's.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#overrides(Method,Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:24.100667913Z"}
{"id":"ba73c7d2-5fda-4b18-bfd2-b6f28226001e","expr":"overrider != null","rationale":"The overrider method must not be null to find its nearest overridden method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:25.062683979Z"}
{"id":"447d678b-4fdf-4736-998d-98ccfcf9a154","expr":"overrider.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"The method's declaring class is needed to search its inherited types for overridden methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:25.062683979Z"}
{"id":"5ac988e7-ebfc-49a0-8105-49dcfae837fb","expr":"overrider.getName() != null","rationale":"The name of the overrider method is required to find the overridden counterpart.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:25.062683979Z"}
{"id":"5d52760d-8209-4198-b377-88b08a08c18a","expr":"overrider.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"The overrider method must have a valid parameter count, which influences method matching.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:25.062683979Z"}
{"id":"2e6943d8-9356-46d8-83b9-7fb2b9b2a72f","expr":"result == null || !result.equals(overrider)","rationale":"The returned 'result' is either null or a method different from 'overrider'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:26.282198199Z"}
{"id":"955bb810-4ce9-461e-a3ac-584caddf0d57","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(overrider.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The declaring class of 'result' should be an ancestor type of the overrider's declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:26.282198199Z"}
{"id":"713b73b7-410d-4eb6-ac6e-425fe2477ef5","expr":"result == null || !result.equals(overrider) && result.getName().equals(overrider.getName())","rationale":"The returned method, if any, overrides the overrider's method by name but is distinct.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findNearestOverriddenMethod(Method):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:26.282198199Z"}
{"id":"ae89d779-043c-483e-aa42-d84ae388acda","expr":"overrider != null","rationale":"The overrider Method must be provided to find an overridden method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:27.200833332Z"}
{"id":"2abf2997-1d00-4f02-af88-04c90eae76b7","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"The declaring class must be specified to look for overridden methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:27.200833332Z"}
{"id":"bab0da6a-8fd9-43d8-98f8-3a11dd2cffd7","expr":"declaringClass.isAssignableFrom(overrider.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"For a method to override, the declaringClass must be assignable from the class of the overrider method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:27.200833332Z"}
{"id":"efd448c1-0fcd-42b2-b592-22bf17ea792b","expr":"overrider.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Valid method must have zero or more parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:27.200833332Z"}
{"id":"7a541681-fc20-452b-b65b-ba5791f010e9","expr":"declaringClass.getMethods().length >= 0","rationale":"The declaring class must have zero or more public methods.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:27.200833332Z"}
{"id":"da83e02e-d776-4bef-b2da-1e5e49087b3c","expr":"result == null || declaringClass.equals(result.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The method findOverriddenMethod returns a method declared in the declaringClass if it returns non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:28.476780631Z"}
{"id":"fc876b99-6c7f-4984-b3f1-a41bd602e330","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(overrider.getName())","rationale":"Overridden methods must have the same name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:28.476780631Z"}
{"id":"346de96e-da73-4625-80ce-4f85f2e4162d","expr":"result == null || result.getReturnType().isAssignableFrom(overrider.getReturnType())","rationale":"Overridden methods have return types compatible via isAssignableFrom.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#findOverriddenMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:28.476780631Z"}
{"id":"e97bc8c5-454f-49b6-9b89-f5c4ef945a41","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must be non-null since we call method.getName() on it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#extractFieldName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:28.716785283Z"}
{"id":"655f39ba-e03d-4ffe-9ab5-71167ca945ef","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method.getName() should return a non-null String based on the JDK Method contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#extractFieldName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:28.716785283Z"}
{"id":"1903302e-122a-4337-93ac-ae7072f43b14","expr":"!method.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"getName() must return a non-empty string to conform with the method contract in Java reflection.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#extractFieldName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:28.716785283Z"}
{"id":"a2703b80-23fc-40b4-8cab-1fcc08822c09","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null string, possibly empty but never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#extractFieldName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:31.126108049Z"}
{"id":"3ffa2f43-3d4a-4a85-ba45-eee8339e4c45","expr":"result.isEmpty() || Character.isLowerCase(result.charAt(0))","rationale":"If the result is non-empty, the first character is lowered to lowercase.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#extractFieldName(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:31.126108049Z"}
{"id":"2bc5b1e9-b874-44fc-b410-bf294be37fa4","expr":"(method == null) == (result == Double.NaN)","rationale":"If method is null, the method returns Double.NaN.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.443178804Z"}
{"id":"ece53839-e2df-465f-90b9-d658208af294","expr":"method != null || Double.isNaN(result)","rationale":"If method is null, result must be Double.NaN.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.443178804Z"}
{"id":"a32da33b-cd52-4e81-b312-8259baf9d455","expr":"!Double.isNaN(result) || method != null","rationale":"If result is NaN then method is null (or an exception occurred).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.443178804Z"}
{"id":"8a645588-0d04-497f-895e-4b2d90e5e3f5","expr":"Double.isNaN(result) || result == ((Double)method.invoke(targetObj)).doubleValue()","rationale":"When method is not null and no exception occurs, result matches the invoked method's double value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.443178804Z"}
{"id":"1afe55a7-f749-4838-a1a6-d42e0af7e127","expr":"method != null || result == Double.NaN","rationale":"Directly from the method code condition.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.443178804Z"}
{"id":"6f78f919-d609-4153-a539-1dddb0d8c8c8","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method object must be non-null to call instance methods safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.473842283Z"}
{"id":"343a7ab8-7a45-4f93-8d55-116be4ad1d57","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"Every method must belong to a declaring class, so this is required.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.473842283Z"}
{"id":"90f4b6e6-8f23-4d35-b0cc-6db4e1f39ac1","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"A Java Method object should always have a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.473842283Z"}
{"id":"40aa0165-6bfe-4171-82bb-2ef3cf919ab0","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"Parameter types array returned by Method is always non-null, possibly empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.473842283Z"}
{"id":"bc4cad48-dfa2-4487-8e03-b9d7458d4a0a","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Array length properties are always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.473842283Z"}
{"id":"26c0448c-6a8b-47fa-9cb7-321cccba1bd4","expr":"result != null","rationale":"toShortString builds a string regardless of method details, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.501989437Z"}
{"id":"59a75f89-bc02-4429-a2b0-322ac691aa41","expr":"result.startsWith(method.getDeclaringClass().getName() + \".\" )","rationale":"The string is constructed starting with the declaring class name and a dot.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.501989437Z"}
{"id":"9bfcd0f5-2d89-45eb-b451-b4ef0152b43b","expr":"result.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"The method appends a closing parenthesis at the end of the string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.501989437Z"}
{"id":"d9a3f43f-587b-400e-a5c2-b410cbeb3486","expr":"result.contains(method.getName())","rationale":"toShortString appends the method's name within the string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.501989437Z"}
{"id":"aba220f0-6ac9-492a-958e-52b0cef9514a","expr":"!result.contains(\"(\") || result.indexOf('(') > (method.getDeclaringClass().getName().length() + 1)","rationale":"String is constructed as 'ClassName.methodName(' so '(' must be after className + dot length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.501989437Z"}
{"id":"b403ebfc-ad49-4da0-94ae-3f8ef76caaff","expr":"md != null","rationale":"The method expects a valid MethodDescriptor object; otherwise, it cannot proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(MethodDescriptor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.523294647Z"}
{"id":"8ec71873-daaf-46fc-9b11-3b90b8b2de95","expr":"md.getParameterClasses() != null","rationale":"The method appends parameter type names, which requires a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(MethodDescriptor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.523294647Z"}
{"id":"b0af9e4c-4405-4c25-9946-a02a74aa7965","expr":"md.getParameterClasses().length >= 0","rationale":"Array lengths in Java are always non-negative, but explicitly stating for clarity.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(MethodDescriptor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.523294647Z"}
{"id":"4de3d9f0-4818-4ebc-a54e-5db355b6862b","expr":"md.getMethodName() != null","rationale":"The toShortString uses md.getMethodName() when the method is null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(MethodDescriptor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.523294647Z"}
{"id":"d13257ce-ba6b-4aac-8dfc-1cf3dc246238","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null string representation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(MethodDescriptor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.542671310Z"}
{"id":"0ce07218-0119-48c9-a8ba-9e65ec34df66","expr":"result.contains(\"(\") && result.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The string representation includes parentheses indicating a method signature format.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(MethodDescriptor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.542671310Z"}
{"id":"00af3e3f-2378-4b4d-abc1-0636f8a5ee71","expr":"md.getParameterClasses().length == 0 || result.contains(md.getParameterClasses()[0].getSimpleName())","rationale":"If there are parameters, the first parameter's simple name appears in the result string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(MethodDescriptor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.542671310Z"}
{"id":"9aa09109-e2a7-49b2-9a58-d9d693aad4af","expr":"result.length() > md.getMethodName().length()","rationale":"Result string is longer than just the method name to include parameters and parentheses.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#toShortString(MethodDescriptor):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.542671310Z"}
{"id":"c9d6aa0b-4d23-45c8-b991-413399ef09aa","expr":"method != null","rationale":"method is expected to be non-null for the method to invoke successfully","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.831010629Z"}
{"id":"eeb7d935-a567-49ca-9386-00874d9d3575","expr":"method.getParameterCount() == 0","rationale":"method.invoke is called without arguments, so parameter count must be zero to avoid IllegalArgumentException","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.831010629Z"}
{"id":"f07dc0cf-4983-4067-b323-094326e2cd60","expr":"(targetObj == null) || method.getDeclaringClass().isInstance(targetObj)","rationale":"targetObj must be an instance of the method's declaring class if not null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.831010629Z"}
{"id":"e974f8ff-db99-46a3-94a5-8d3261e965e7","expr":"method.isAccessible() || method.trySetAccessible()","rationale":"Method must be accessible or made accessible to invoke","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnDouble(Method,Object):double","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:32.831010629Z"}
{"id":"af09c6ee-d186-46f1-8815-57b2804658a0","expr":"method == null || method.getParameterCount() == 0","rationale":"Since invoke is called without arguments, the method should not require parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.MethodUtils#invokeAndReturnLong(Method,Object):long","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/MethodUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:35:33.404985185Z"}
