{"id":"2d45ffd5-1bf4-48e9-a130-d33ca8024adc","expr":"result.getParameterTypes()[0].isAssignableFrom(paramType)","rationale":"The method returns a constructor whose one parameter type can accept paramType.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Constructor<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:43.262097882Z"}
{"id":"a9cc4fc8-3d4e-4bda-b1c1-7cc718baebf2","expr":"result.getDeclaringClass() == clazz","rationale":"The constructor returned by getConstructor or getConstructors must belong to clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Constructor<?>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:43.262097882Z"}
{"id":"95f80d76-c49e-49de-8d2b-96b264899200","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Since we are searching for a method within a class, the class parameter must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:43.721207330Z"}
{"id":"493c95bd-28a1-41ab-b49b-77717a446f2a","expr":"methodName != null && !methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method name cannot be null or empty because it is necessary to identify the method to find.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:43.721207330Z"}
{"id":"494bfb97-4723-4676-a643-ccc97d02955b","expr":"methodName.indexOf('(') == -1 || methodName.endsWith(\")\")","rationale":"Based on the javadoc, methodName can contain parameters in parentheses, so if '(' is present, it should end with ')'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:43.721207330Z"}
{"id":"c582eb6f-9e6a-4407-a55a-9ac52041a074","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"This asserts clazz is indeed a class object representing itself or a supertype; given as a simple true expression for class reference.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:43.721207330Z"}
{"id":"3c80f981-85cf-4d87-858a-b42165aef26e","expr":"result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"The method returned by findMethodByMethodSignature will have the exact methodName as the input parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.589515160Z"}
{"id":"81d5a132-1685-46d2-8adf-df56ededeafa","expr":"result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"The returned method is obtained from clazz.getMethods(), so it must be declared in clazz or its superclasses.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.589515160Z"}
{"id":"df60f8e7-e5cd-4344-9efd-55a06852c6d1","expr":"(parameterTypes == null) == (result.getParameterCount() >= 0)","rationale":"ParameterTypes null implies the method was found by name uniqueness, non-null implies exact method signature match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.589515160Z"}
{"id":"ff7f9c57-a810-415b-8d8d-8e8856be519c","expr":"(parameterTypes != null) == (result.getParameterTypes().length == parameterTypes.length)","rationale":"When parameterTypes is not null, the returned method's parameter array length matches.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.589515160Z"}
{"id":"2d64aaa1-8457-4d72-9c52-ba0371ee9070","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method will throw exceptions if no method found, so result must be non-null at return.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodSignature(Class<?>,String,String[]):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.589515160Z"}
{"id":"03959274-a984-48a6-8b28-b2c467237ad5","expr":"returnType != null","rationale":"The method likely requires the class type for construction or retrieval of an empty object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.690006769Z"}
{"id":"fe70c322-494d-424e-8cee-19f10690c49c","expr":"returnType.isPrimitive() || returnType.isArray() || returnType.isInterface() || !returnType.isPrimitive()","rationale":"These are the possible categories for Class<?> in Java.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.690006769Z"}
{"id":"8f1f406b-2e97-48d5-bb95-6a1252617d4d","expr":"result == null || returnType.isInstance(result)","rationale":"The method returns an instance of the specified Class or null if none.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.788801799Z"}
{"id":"e2b834a0-89db-457d-b4bd-2e555e08fe7e","expr":"result != null || true","rationale":"The method may return null if no empty object can be created; otherwise, some object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.788801799Z"}
{"id":"15b6f9ca-401c-44c7-b99b-7c38b7ba7074","expr":"result == null || result.getClass().isAssignableFrom(returnType)","rationale":"Ensures the result object is assignable to the returnType class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.788801799Z"}
{"id":"5620ae2e-0443-4e22-8a37-3d8e6e313d9a","expr":"level >= 0","rationale":"level is used as a recursion depth counter and thus non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.887647825Z"}
{"id":"d4ce865e-d0dd-4a76-ad71-21bf0b7820ff","expr":"level <= 2 || returnType == null","rationale":"If level is greater than 2, the method returns null early; thus, either level <= 2 or returnType is null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.887647825Z"}
{"id":"339b732b-a5c4-4856-b9e7-eda6e907702b","expr":"!returnType.isPrimitive() || (returnType != null)","rationale":"If returnType is primitive, it can't be null; otherwise, returnType could be null but that case returns early.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.887647825Z"}
{"id":"7edfdc9e-c11d-4a6e-9c39-2db775830d90","expr":"emptyInstances != null","rationale":"emptyInstances is called as a Map and used without null checks, so it must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.887647825Z"}
{"id":"b9515dae-9f64-4750-8dbc-2b018a3d8369","expr":"(!returnType.isArray() || returnType.getComponentType() != null)","rationale":"If returnType is array, its component type must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.887647825Z"}
{"id":"04f08196-21b3-44c1-850f-d1831d21d5c2","expr":"(returnType.isArray()) == (result != null && result.getClass().isArray() && result.getClass().getComponentType().equals(returnType.getComponentType()))","rationale":"Ensures that for array types, result is an array instance of matching component type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getEmptyObject(Class<?>,Map<Class<?>, Object>,int):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:44.987428177Z"}
{"id":"2df802ae-ca48-41fa-ac51-f090f4bf5c5c","expr":"m != null","rationale":"The method uses m.getReturnType(), so m must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Method):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.085397566Z"}
{"id":"4cdf3390-ffa5-4132-bbb8-ce5c9acaea38","expr":"m.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"The method calls isPrimitive() on m.getReturnType(), so getReturnType() must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Method):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.085397566Z"}
{"id":"99ce684c-36aa-43ec-aef2-3340a791fb25","expr":"result == null || m.getReturnType().isPrimitive()","rationale":"If the return type is primitive, the result is the default primitive value, otherwise null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Method):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.182972404Z"}
{"id":"1e294c03-6250-4c28-8a1a-a82b7c95a013","expr":"(!m.getReturnType().isPrimitive() && result == null) || (m.getReturnType().isPrimitive() && result != null)","rationale":"Result is null if and only if the return type is not primitive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Method):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.182972404Z"}
{"id":"d7c8ccd1-9435-4de9-afd7-cf714ef498bd","expr":"!classType.isPrimitive() || classType != null","rationale":"If classType is primitive, then it must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.281033676Z"}
{"id":"1f26de83-9aae-4080-accb-48a8809e1ca7","expr":"classType != null || !classType.isPrimitive()","rationale":"isPrimitive can only be called if classType is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.281033676Z"}
{"id":"08ea1640-91f0-40ff-b9bc-739c75d67984","expr":"classType == null || classType.isPrimitive() || result == null","rationale":"The method returns a default value from primitiveDefaults when classType is primitive; otherwise, it returns null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.379385844Z"}
{"id":"257f2d1d-78c8-41f5-80de-e081693d4886","expr":"(classType != null && classType.isPrimitive()) || result == null","rationale":"Ensures that result is only non-null when classType is primitive and non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.379385844Z"}
{"id":"22cd4591-3066-4684-848e-a39333509419","expr":"result == null || classType.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Because primitiveDefaults maps primitive types, result non-null indicates primitive classType.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#defaultReturn(Class<?>):Object","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.379385844Z"}
{"id":"73c4ceca-dc47-47b6-ad4d-9a0d05bc1f5e","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length == 0","rationale":"Bean property read methods have no parameters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyReadMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.477541012Z"}
{"id":"e950303e-db2e-4f8c-b5ad-c655e701201a","expr":"!result || method.getParameterTypes().length == 0","rationale":"Bean property read methods are no-arg methods.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyReadMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.576155122Z"}
{"id":"4efd9aed-8d27-4ad5-8b71-0e0ea8c66701","expr":"method != null","rationale":"Ensures safety when invoking method instance methods later.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanReadMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.674119552Z"}
{"id":"847f1a9d-33ea-4a3f-b301-208fe142d39b","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method.getName() is defined to return a non-null string in the standard JDK.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanReadMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.674119552Z"}
{"id":"0520bff0-41b3-42ae-b94c-bd658b30dcfc","expr":"result == null || (result.length() >= 1 && Character.isLowerCase(result.charAt(0)))","rationale":"The returned property name starts with a lowercase character if it is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanReadMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.772597567Z"}
{"id":"5e10b32c-0dbd-4769-8143-39f08df8c82d","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method must not be null as per the method's initial null check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.869966908Z"}
{"id":"ec543986-7900-4e6c-8a6d-34b968a60c4f","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length == 1","rationale":"Bean property write methods have exactly one parameter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.869966908Z"}
{"id":"86483ea8-ac91-4579-bcc9-af22376eaa4e","expr":"method.getName().length() > 3","rationale":"Names of bean write methods have more than 3 characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.869966908Z"}
{"id":"9340f5c9-7860-489e-844f-70436eb9eefc","expr":"!result || (method != null)","rationale":"If the method is a bean property write method, the method object cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.968582421Z"}
{"id":"d6ebd3ea-2a60-42f9-9012-2baedd8c9a66","expr":"!result || (method.getParameterTypes().length == 1)","rationale":"A bean property write method takes exactly one parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isBeanPropertyWriteMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:45.968582421Z"}
{"id":"d943ca35-05dc-4e47-b86a-b5a3b45b177e","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter should not be null to safely invoke method operations.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.067335743Z"}
{"id":"9a074782-b538-4fe7-b893-3a483f11ac10","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Reflection Method.getName() never returns null, so this invariant holds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.067335743Z"}
{"id":"0a7befc6-50ae-423d-a62a-a8efc5f84156","expr":"method.getName().length() >= 4","rationale":"Since substring(3,4) is called if the method is a bean write method, the name has to be long enough.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.067335743Z"}
{"id":"1a505243-1ac0-4c7b-965c-54432193ba82","expr":"result == null || (result.length() >= 1 && result.equals(method.getName().substring(3, 4).toLowerCase() + method.getName().substring(4)))","rationale":"The method returns null if method is not a bean property write method; otherwise, result is constructed from method.getName() as substring(3,4).toLowerCase() + substring(4).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.165972647Z"}
{"id":"f1f5a544-837e-4db5-91b4-bccea98aa8c4","expr":"result == null || Character.isLowerCase(result.charAt(0))","rationale":"Result is a property name derived by converting the first character of the suffix to lowercase.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.165972647Z"}
{"id":"7fe1c90b-afac-4e8a-9606-a19524216e87","expr":"result == null || !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The property name returned is nonempty string when not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getPropertyNameFromBeanWriteMethod(Method):String","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.165972647Z"}
{"id":"cf0a9d09-dbc6-4599-8634-1b676c522d3a","expr":"obj.getClass() != null","rationale":"Because obj is non-null, obj.getClass() should be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.242543868Z"}
{"id":"816dbdd9-7959-41ed-a61c-779a7d673ccb","expr":"interfaceClazzName != null && !interfaceClazzName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method compares interfaceClazzName with interface names so it should be non-null and not empty","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.242543868Z"}
{"id":"7828bff1-6b22-4032-8a5f-fc923d7940f3","expr":"obj != null","rationale":"obj must not be null to call getClass()","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.242543868Z"}
{"id":"43241204-ece7-4e59-bf84-0e4888389a60","expr":"field != null","rationale":"The field object must be non-null to access its methods and properties.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isPublicInstanceField(Field):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.264191575Z"}
{"id":"83adac5d-f23c-4487-8cdf-4d3f792bf936","expr":"result || field.isSynthetic()","rationale":"If result is true, field is not synthetic; else it might be synthetic.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isPublicInstanceField(Field):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.332358393Z"}
{"id":"ccd54d8a-e2d5-47d3-a019-5ea6e4e57c08","expr":"cl != null","rationale":"The method iterates on the class hierarchy starting from cl, so cl must be not null to begin with.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.357954760Z"}
{"id":"4f3160a1-ffc2-4f4a-9d58-e391bc66d6dd","expr":"cl.getDeclaredFields() != null","rationale":"Assuming Java standard behavior, getDeclaredFields returns an array of fields and is never null, so this invariant reflects that.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.357954760Z"}
{"id":"c726e523-cdef-443a-ae94-688599d27dbd","expr":"cl.getSuperclass() != cl","rationale":"Class.getSuperclass returns the immediate superclass, which can never be equal to the class itself.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.357954760Z"}
{"id":"8184bce7-96ac-4cf8-a012-785b04a861de","expr":"cl.getName() != null","rationale":"Every Class object has a non-null name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.357954760Z"}
{"id":"5933a796-a4ab-4434-bbd4-b9d8af0e1a04","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a newly created HashMap, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.393534536Z"}
{"id":"eb9cddab-f74b-43e2-bf73-c4ba0f677d76","expr":"cl != null || result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If input class is null, then the map would be empty because the loop never runs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyFields(Class):Map<String, Field>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.393534536Z"}
{"id":"40e274d7-881c-4243-a0aa-76fc5a3fef01","expr":"cl != null","rationale":"The method loops over cl and its superclasses, so cl must be non-null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.420988684Z"}
{"id":"37d2cd65-8549-4b83-9b71-9b9428efcc4b","expr":"cl.getDeclaredMethods() != null","rationale":"Java API guarantees getDeclaredMethods never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.420988684Z"}
{"id":"56119a0e-081f-454a-9a46-0a98e8bb3fb3","expr":"cl.isInterface() == false","rationale":"Ensures cl is a class, not an interface, since the method deals with properties to read.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.420988684Z"}
{"id":"335a28bf-a8c0-46f2-b1b8-e82178d9d11b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a Map, initialized as a new HashMap, so result should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.451502340Z"}
{"id":"59cbf976-f20a-4db2-ba03-9bb1c4877277","expr":"cl != null || !result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If the input class is null, the result map will contain entries only if the method populated from the class hierarchy started from a non-null class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.451502340Z"}
{"id":"f9cbe639-d855-45bd-aaf4-eef86599fbf8","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || cl == null","rationale":"If the input class is null, the result map should logically be empty, since there is no class hierarchy to inspect.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getBeanPropertyReadMethods(Class):Map<String, Method>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.451502340Z"}
{"id":"284bd01a-8c42-48f0-9363-0a315e7af186","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter is expected to be non-null to retrieve return types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getReturnTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.476140847Z"}
{"id":"901f3483-1c5b-4eaf-b036-2519ca58b2fd","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"Method.getReturnType() in standard Java API never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getReturnTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.476140847Z"}
{"id":"5b6ff4c5-832a-4dc0-9338-c9c8e709809b","expr":"method.getGenericReturnType() != null","rationale":"Method.getGenericReturnType() always returns a Type instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getReturnTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:46.476140847Z"}
{"id":"abfefeb7-9dc0-4f74-90b4-33e8deee5e0b","expr":"result == null || clazz.isAssignableFrom(result.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The returned Method, if not null, must belong to the class or its superclass to which we're searching.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:47.319896072Z"}
{"id":"27e47ad2-4d59-4839-92c5-ef64a66dff3f","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName.split(\"\\\\(\")[0])","rationale":"The methodName parameter may include parameter signatures, but the base method name must match the found method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:47.319896072Z"}
{"id":"13c64b9d-d91f-4851-8da4-ceb7705a1d33","expr":"result == null || (result.getName() != null && !result.getName().isEmpty())","rationale":"A valid Method instance returned should have a non-null, non-empty name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findMethodByMethodName(Class<?>,String):Method","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:47.319896072Z"}
{"id":"c7550929-d339-466a-9ecc-f1cc6060d417","expr":"obj != null || !result","rationale":"If obj is null, the method cannot find any interfaces, so result must be false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:47.742702956Z"}
{"id":"320bbf9c-2796-43bc-9084-8cc5329828ba","expr":"!result || interfaceClazzName != null","rationale":"To have a true result, the target interface name must be non-null to match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:47.742702956Z"}
{"id":"8629c638-eb08-4884-b937-25becb33961a","expr":"!result || obj.getClass().isAssignableFrom(obj.getClass())","rationale":"If result is true, the object's class is well-defined and assignable from itself.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:47.742702956Z"}
{"id":"368bff97-90d8-4e85-9a6c-ec521ec1d43e","expr":"!result || !(interfaceClazzName.isEmpty())","rationale":"It's meaningful only to check a non-empty interface name to have a true result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isInstance(Object,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:47.742702956Z"}
{"id":"d8bf3c2f-a733-4c26-bcb1-e69ce0b4c7b1","expr":"sourceClass != null","rationale":"The sourceClass parameter should be non-null to find parameterized types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:49.776156389Z"}
{"id":"dd092f0c-846e-4c7d-ae1e-c508a2a33e18","expr":"sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces() != null","rationale":"Underlying array of generic interfaces is non-null, allowing safe conversion to list.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:49.776156389Z"}
{"id":"1787831a-a2d7-49ca-9f7e-a81ef296d850","expr":"!sourceClass.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Primitive classes cannot have parameterized types, so sourceClass usually is not primitive at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:49.776156389Z"}
{"id":"16b9c268-e2a3-4242-9368-d42e025c1014","expr":"result != null","rationale":"From the method's javadoc and implementation, the returned Set is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:50.491611101Z"}
{"id":"2a3fc66e-6369-4d4c-91f5-53e291b9fd9a","expr":"!result.isEmpty() || sourceClass == null || (sourceClass.getGenericInterfaces().length == 0 && sourceClass.getGenericSuperclass() == null)","rationale":"Based on the method logic, result could be empty only if sourceClass has no parameterized generic interfaces or superclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findParameterizedTypes(Class<?>):Set<ParameterizedType>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:50.491611101Z"}
{"id":"e928f649-b79e-4937-9d2a-90be9d71275e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Method javadoc states the return is a non-null read-only set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:52.063537474Z"}
{"id":"56eed1af-6138-48b7-b641-cd1c9e5455bd","expr":"!result.contains(null)","rationale":"Based on context, the set contains classes found in hierarchy, which cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:52.063537474Z"}
{"id":"fe040359-e831-40a7-8ce5-61a3f2784460","expr":"(sourceClass == null) == result.isEmpty()","rationale":"If sourceClass is null, method returns empty set, else result might be empty or not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:52.063537474Z"}
{"id":"58bef771-1fb3-4d4e-949f-7b88788c5255","expr":"sourceClass == null || matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass)","rationale":"At method entry, if sourceClass is not null, then matchType.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass) can be true if sourceClass is going to be included in the result.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:52.675037420Z"}
{"id":"02fba9ac-6b5b-4967-8063-326192162ed1","expr":"matchType != null","rationale":"matchType must not be null to call isAssignableFrom and for correct matching logic.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:52.675037420Z"}
{"id":"7d871a9e-d5b7-4f8f-8df4-ef1a7386e12e","expr":"sourceClass == null || sourceClass.isAssignableFrom(sourceClass)","rationale":"A class is always assignable from itself (always true unless sourceClass is null).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:52.675037420Z"}
{"id":"722fad55-7dcf-47dc-b6c7-288cf00da220","expr":"sourceClass == null || matchType.isInterface() || !matchType.isInterface()","rationale":"matchType is either an interface or not (this captures basic type classification).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#findHierarchicalTypes(Class<?>,Class<T>):Set<Class<T>>","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:52.675037420Z"}
{"id":"bcc0bd9d-81b8-458c-bc54-ef3b9c30503c","expr":"beanClass != null","rationale":"The method operates on beanClass to retrieve its BeanInfo, so beanClass should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.320049330Z"}
{"id":"6da762dc-94e8-4639-960b-f5dcdc5899fa","expr":"methodName != null","rationale":"The methodName parameter is used to compare against MethodDescriptor names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.320049330Z"}
{"id":"800149d2-e668-47a6-801c-e39b97ba95dc","expr":"beanClass.isInterface() || beanClass.isArray() || beanClass.isPrimitive() || true","rationale":"BeanInfo can be retrieved for various kinds of Class objects including interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.320049330Z"}
{"id":"ee3e1c5d-30ae-45f0-9f36-cb9258ad5689","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically methodName would not be empty string as valid method names are not empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.320049330Z"}
{"id":"17ee0e2f-5834-4477-889b-c76c9e6607ee","expr":"beanClass.getName() != null","rationale":"beanClass.getName() always returns a non-null string representation of the class name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.320049330Z"}
{"id":"2b743682-de6d-4fba-84d6-95b36e5fc739","expr":"(result == null) || (bean != null && methodName != null)","rationale":"If a property value is returned non-null, it means the bean and methodName were validly used to invoke the getter, so bean and methodName must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.711554386Z"}
{"id":"bd929919-c5f3-4e15-a567-7ece190edecc","expr":"(result == null) || result.equals(result)","rationale":"If result is not null, then invoking equals on result itself must be true, asserting result is a valid object reference.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#getProperty(Object,String):T","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.711554386Z"}
{"id":"f1608dc1-9da6-401a-9ea9-a3d821f1580e","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The parameter clazz must be non-null to safely call clazz.getDeclaredConstructor() without throwing NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.800245851Z"}
{"id":"ff77fd8e-931a-4b52-a2ec-659e2f0df8da","expr":"clazz.isInterface() == false","rationale":"If clazz is an interface, getDeclaredConstructor() would throw NoSuchMethodException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.800245851Z"}
{"id":"3f8b5fd2-f7e5-4cc0-a57a-b0437de04b6f","expr":"clazz.isArray() == false","rationale":"If clazz is an array class, getDeclaredConstructor() would likely throw NoSuchMethodException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.800245851Z"}
{"id":"0de26200-7134-4429-a2f2-82e96405698a","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"If clazz represents a primitive type, getDeclaredConstructor() would throw NoSuchMethodException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.800245851Z"}
{"id":"a856a5be-8bba-416f-9a79-e40809510f22","expr":"clazz.getDeclaredConstructors().length >= 0","rationale":"The class may have zero or more constructors declared, since constructor count is never negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.800245851Z"}
{"id":"7f722ba9-4315-47ad-a4c2-4a26ed9128c6","expr":"result == (clazz.getDeclaredConstructor() != null)","rationale":"If getDeclaredConstructor() returns without exception, result is true; otherwise false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.866888125Z"}
{"id":"7a2c32de-a739-4ac8-a11a-d0fccf618a96","expr":"!result || clazz.getDeclaredConstructor().getParameterCount() == 0","rationale":"If the zero-arg constructor exists (result == true), then the constructor's parameter count must be zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.866888125Z"}
{"id":"698f1eb6-5234-47f8-8489-a9fe65eda394","expr":"result == clazz.getDeclaredConstructors().length > 0","rationale":"If the class has no constructors, getDeclaredConstructor() throws NoSuchMethodException, so result false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#checkZeroArgConstructor(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.866888125Z"}
{"id":"583836ed-b769-491a-80bf-8965fbff6a38","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Since the method calls clazz.getName(), clazz must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isJdk(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.928775074Z"}
{"id":"cd758726-9342-4003-9e1b-7753b6b7a490","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Class.getName() returns a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isJdk(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.928775074Z"}
{"id":"806835e6-0030-4698-a8e8-41b93f456725","expr":"clazz.getName().length() >= 5","rationale":"The class name must be at least 5 characters long to start with \"java.\" or \"javax.\".","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#isJdk(Class):boolean","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:55.928775074Z"}
{"id":"76d3bfa6-45ed-4190-b681-e7362e516e4f","expr":"values == null || values.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always greater or equal to zero when values is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#resolveTypes(Object):Class[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:56.432891381Z"}
{"id":"e38315d6-ed96-43e7-967d-ff302a064586","expr":"values != null || values == null","rationale":"This is logically true but included because no further relation to types can be inferred at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.ReflectUtils#resolveTypes(Object):Class[]","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/ReflectUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:36:56.432891381Z"}
