{"id":"315bd084-2ee3-4c16-b6c6-8568506ebc25","expr":"throwable == null || logger.isTraceEnabled()","rationale":"If throwable is non-null at exit, implies logger's trace is enabled, because only then we call logger.trace(throwable).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.662159078Z"}
