{"id":"753318d8-abf0-4360-9f14-07eaed4a38c4","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If trace is enabled, at least one of msg or e is likely being passed as argument to trace method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.667499483Z"}
{"id":"8bed83b6-d76b-40fa-8c77-9fcc1d0ce6cd","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"If msg is non-null, its length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.667499483Z"}
{"id":"54dc84cb-3e87-46c3-b6c4-56b8691a4669","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Since the method returns if logger is null, at the exit logger must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.673120299Z"}
{"id":"4d2e1441-35c2-41d6-879a-54900930ba59","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If trace logging is enabled, the method calls logger.trace with msg and e; at least one is likely non-null or relevant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.673120299Z"}
{"id":"ba96293e-cdfd-41e6-aeaa-1799e97ee920","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || msg != null","rationale":"If trace is enabled, msg is passed to logger.trace, so msg should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.673120299Z"}
{"id":"3d86b230-98df-471a-93c8-c002f5ed9911","expr":"!logger.isTraceEnabled() || true","rationale":"Throwable e may or may not be null when logger.trace is called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#trace(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.673120299Z"}
{"id":"f0075108-523c-4e99-9d8f-dcf2b46a2749","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger is non-null after this point.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.678600740Z"}
{"id":"c72816d4-a3d7-4a6d-b53c-e482e2ec4aad","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || msg != null","rationale":"If debug is enabled, msg is passed to logger.debug, so msg is expected to be non-null or safely handled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.678600740Z"}
{"id":"c4cb6648-aa17-4ff5-a058-3d9d046f247c","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() == true || logger.isDebugEnabled() == false","rationale":"isDebugEnabled returns a boolean value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.678600740Z"}
{"id":"ec3c0b71-e5fd-43e2-b55a-9c4701a0fe4f","expr":"msg == null || msg != null","rationale":"msg is any string, possibly null, but allowed to be passed to debug method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.678600740Z"}
{"id":"814eb331-4658-49ca-9959-e6226da50a90","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"logger is checked for null at the start and the method returns if it is null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.683590740Z"}
{"id":"386f1090-ed9e-433a-ace4-50684b47edf3","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (msg != null)","rationale":"If debug logging is enabled, debug(msg) is called, so presumably msg should not be null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.683590740Z"}
{"id":"cc47b821-5a59-4ce9-b231-e3fedcf44901","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || true","rationale":"If debugEnabled is false, no logging occurs","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.683590740Z"}
{"id":"a8a10135-32e6-4a25-8ad3-7fe0a44d6de5","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || true","rationale":"logger.isDebugEnabled() is a predicate method influencing behavior","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.683590740Z"}
{"id":"2c4bf873-9b81-4f74-bd3f-1b321880d797","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger is usually non-null when executing further.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.688739110Z"}
{"id":"293fa3fc-10c8-49ee-93c9-9db1de43a0a4","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || !logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"This is trivially true and not meaningful, so it should be ignored in real usage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.688739110Z"}
{"id":"e319bed6-dd9c-4ec0-b11c-16079d20e62a","expr":"(!logger.isDebugEnabled() || e == null) || (logger.isDebugEnabled() && true)","rationale":"If debug is enabled, the debug call accepts e, which can be null or non-null; this expression represents logical states but is trivial.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.688739110Z"}
{"id":"4ff1e5c6-6445-46d4-8df1-28e3f719af08","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Since the method returns early if logger is null, logger is not null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.693844409Z"}
{"id":"44973377-63ab-497b-9bf3-8e3d16b52c47","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || e == null || logger.isDebugEnabled()","rationale":"If debug logging is enabled, logger.debug is called with e, thus isDebugEnabled is true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.693844409Z"}
{"id":"77e8f86a-46da-4e43-a647-aef477cdadc2","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || e != null || e == null","rationale":"No constraints on e; it can be null or non-null independent of isDebugEnabled.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.693844409Z"}
{"id":"9eaead5b-bdf6-45f1-8150-c6b37ac2ebbc","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"Since the method returns immediately if logger is null, logger is not null at the main execution points.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.698920303Z"}
{"id":"59ea812a-c344-49df-a034-53185ac6e112","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || msg == null","rationale":"If debug is not enabled, msg does not have to be non-null since debug is not called. If debug is enabled, msg can be any value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.698920303Z"}
{"id":"cace7d8c-dddc-48f6-be84-4d3d8c76892d","expr":"logger.isDebugEnabled() || e == null","rationale":"Similar reasoning as with msg, e may be null or non-null if debug is not enabled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.698920303Z"}
{"id":"bc64c89e-0cf3-4f87-a203-19d692df1d68","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns early if logger is null, so logger is non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.704148064Z"}
{"id":"0e2997ce-efbf-4d51-8e57-4194d4b25e5d","expr":"!logger.isDebugEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If debug is enabled, then debug(msg, e) is called, which expects at least one of msg or e may be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#debug(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.704148064Z"}
{"id":"b0b1682a-89e8-422b-997d-3e5528ae55c1","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns early if logger is null, so logger is non-null after the early return","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.709238415Z"}
{"id":"e27107e9-494f-428c-9f5e-9f46e81acbd7","expr":"msg == null || msg.length() >= 0","rationale":"msg can be null or a valid string; no constraint to assert positivity but we can assert that if msg is non-null, it has a non-negative length","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.709238415Z"}
{"id":"7fe36d14-0a88-435e-a60b-cac5ddb4978c","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || true","rationale":"If info is enabled, the logger.info(msg) is called; invariant captures that the logging depends on info enabled","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.709238415Z"}
{"id":"b385fb0e-1f77-4bb7-8940-c40438b3eb2f","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() == (logger != null && logger.isInfoEnabled())","rationale":"logger.isInfoEnabled can safely be called as logger is non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.709238415Z"}
{"id":"6f5b3d1c-ca03-428b-8919-4d1fe8e3f11f","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The early return prevents further code execution if logger is null; hence, at method exit, logger is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.715864908Z"}
{"id":"5f379735-d1e1-4517-a43d-135eff47f70f","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && msg != null)","rationale":"If info logging is enabled, the message is used; thus, if info is enabled, msg should be the argument passed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.715864908Z"}
{"id":"d0642208-38a3-4d3d-b313-8b396b7f8b30","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && msg == null || msg != null)","rationale":"This is effectively tautological and should be avoided. Including here only as illustration.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.715864908Z"}
{"id":"871a1bf4-9ab2-4a29-a211-cfe749b04cf4","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The first line in the method checks if logger is null and returns if so, so at method entry, if this point is drawn from the start of method, logger is assumed non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.720868203Z"}
{"id":"62f00010-9433-40d9-8ccb-ad4024f5b0de","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() == false || logger.isInfoEnabled() == true","rationale":"This Boolean expression is a tautology; it is included only to document that isInfoEnabled() returns boolean. But it's trivial, so likely omit.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.720868203Z"}
{"id":"0a00f884-88c4-462a-b1c6-1b3d3de98cf4","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger is definitely non-null here.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.725733157Z"}
{"id":"9873022e-efb1-41f4-91d3-50e90fff5614","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || e != null","rationale":"If info is enabled, then logger.info(e) was called with e, so if e is null, logging with null is possible, but to be precise this reflects that e might or might not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.725733157Z"}
{"id":"daecb053-e1e4-4f86-a0d4-8fd25edc2840","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger must be non-null to proceed","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.730924789Z"}
{"id":"0f62e472-a910-488c-929a-f79c9ff0834e","expr":"logger.isInfoEnabled() == true || logger.isInfoEnabled() == false","rationale":"logger.isInfoEnabled() returns a boolean","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.730924789Z"}
{"id":"dbc40b08-178f-4f19-b682-4a9d0b281905","expr":"msg == null || msg != null","rationale":"msg is passed through to logger.info as is, may be null or not","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.730924789Z"}
{"id":"d626d514-a715-4d2f-8c63-b3fe684f4fd5","expr":"e == null || e != null","rationale":"e is passed through to logger.info as is, may be null or not","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.730924789Z"}
{"id":"2485f692-8476-415d-bd7d-2ec6dd28bc32","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || logger.info(msg, e) == null","rationale":"logger.info is called only if logger.isInfoEnabled() is true","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.730924789Z"}
{"id":"31878634-cf7e-4e8b-9ad9-c1e18c45d46f","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method cannot reach the exit point with logger being null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.736277748Z"}
{"id":"d7cdb52b-e9e3-4af3-8cb0-fcbafc242dd7","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && msg != null)","rationale":"If the logger is enabled for info, logger.info is called with msg and e, so msg should be non-null to be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.736277748Z"}
{"id":"606e34da-50be-4ab1-94da-46528649f52c","expr":"!logger.isInfoEnabled() || (logger.isInfoEnabled() && e != null)","rationale":"When info is enabled, the logging method is called with exception e (which may be null but is passed).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#info(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.736277748Z"}
{"id":"10f92b42-b321-4869-a2aa-f81f967ca588","expr":"msg != null || msg == null","rationale":"msg is unconstrained and can be null or non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.741697393Z"}
{"id":"99755783-fcbd-4576-ba33-4259a0880d17","expr":"e != null || e == null","rationale":"Exception parameter can be null or non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.741697393Z"}
{"id":"b2a9e6f8-4635-47bb-8fc2-56c40bf46f48","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger is non-null on exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.746685510Z"}
{"id":"f9a178ff-0eea-45b3-b8a3-cbd375507bb2","expr":"!logger.isWarnEnabled() || (msg != null || e != null)","rationale":"If warning is logged, at least one of msg or e usually is non-null to provide information.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.746685510Z"}
{"id":"41ea8a00-bc2c-46e9-a64d-f1d44f4dd71a","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() == (msg != null || e != null || true)","rationale":"This expression illustrates the conditional invocation of warn method; the message or exception may be null regardless of isWarnEnabled.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.746685510Z"}
{"id":"a0681c71-052c-4718-b791-b46a45cf8bfa","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger is non-null at points after the null-check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.751857606Z"}
{"id":"538869c7-d4cb-4dbc-bb95-d7d525685422","expr":"logger.isWarnEnabled() == (logger != null && logger.isWarnEnabled())","rationale":"Since logger is non-null, logger.isWarnEnabled() can be called safely and returns a boolean indicating if warning is enabled.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.751857606Z"}
{"id":"d0ed0d20-1ed5-4c1d-bd85-aba72ba0f33b","expr":"(!logger.isWarnEnabled()) || (logger.isWarnEnabled() && true)","rationale":"logger.isWarnEnabled() returns a boolean; included for completeness and represents program branching condition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.751857606Z"}
{"id":"c9d46c4c-0851-42ea-b375-7a4428352766","expr":"logger.getName() != null","rationale":"Assuming typical Logger implementations, name is expected to be non-null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.751857606Z"}
{"id":"9d1cc8a5-fc1b-4dee-ac7b-84333eb20aa9","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method returns immediately if logger is null, so logger must be non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.757265198Z"}
{"id":"5a5fc2ae-8646-4090-bf23-be0993393b03","expr":"!logger.isWarnEnabled() || msg != null","rationale":"If warning is enabled, msg is passed to logger.warn(), so msg should not be null in that case to avoid NullPointerExceptions or meaningless logs.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,String):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.757265198Z"}
