{"id":"dd7a0bee-ca88-4ee6-adee-091684189c87","expr":"logger != null","rationale":"The method first checks if logger is null and returns immediately, so at method exit logger cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.apache.dubbo.common.utils.LogHelper#warn(Logger,Throwable):void","file":"org/apache/dubbo/common/utils/LogHelper.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T03:39:11.768074020Z"}
